<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Data setup · TTRPG Card Generator</title><link rel="icon" href="/icons/favicon.svg"><style>__SHELL_CSS__</style></head><body><header class="topbar"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">T</span><span class="brand-name">TTRPG Card Generator</span></a><span class="badge">Data setup</span></header><main class="setup-page"><div class="eyebrow">Your collection, your choice</div><h1>Bring your library<br>to the table.</h1><p class="setup-intro">Connect a compatible data repository or import a ZIP archive. Your content stays on this device.</p><section id="ready-panel" class="ready-banner" hidden><div><strong>Your data is ready.</strong><div class="help">Open the workbench or replace your data source below.</div></div><button id="launch-button" class="primary">Open workbench →</button></section><button id="manage-button" class="quiet" hidden>Manage data source</button><div id="import-panels"><section class="panel setup-panel"><div class="eyebrow">From a repository</div><h2 id="repository-title">Connect your source.</h2><p id="repository-help" class="help">Enter the Git URL of a compatible repository.</p><form id="repository-form"><div class="field"><label id="repository-label" for="repository-url">Repository URL</label><input id="repository-url" type="url" placeholder="https://github.com/example/my-data.git" required autocomplete="url"></div><button id="repository-button" type="submit" class="primary">Import repository</button></form></section><section class="panel setup-panel"><div class="eyebrow">From your device</div><h2>Already have a ZIP?</h2><p class="help">Choose an archive containing a compatible data folder. Existing data is replaced only after a successful import.</p><form id="zip-form"><div class="field"><label for="dataset-zip">Data archive</label><input id="dataset-zip" type="file" accept=".zip,application/zip,application/x-zip-compressed"></div><button id="zip-button" type="submit">Import ZIP archive</button></form></section></div><div id="setup-status" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div><p class="help" style="margin-top:25px">Use a repository with data/class and data/spells folders. No data source is preselected.</p><p class="help"><a href="/about">About &amp; licenses</a></p></main><script>window.SETUP=__BOOTSTRAP__;</script><script>__SCRIPT__</script></body></html>
